  "releaseNotes": "* 1.1.4 - Fixed Payment-related DTOs.\n\t\t\t* 1.1.3 - Fixed MunicipalServiceDto.\n\t\t\t* 1.1.2 - Implemented missing methods in FiscalService.\n\t\t\t* 1.1.1 - Added missing DTOs for a few services.\n\t\t\t* 1.1.0 - Fixed DefaultHeadersHandler ApiKey assignment.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.9 - Fixed DefaultHeadersHandler initialization issue.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.8 - Implemented missing DTOs related to Transfer and Finance services.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.7 - Implemented missing DTOs related to Webhook services.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.6 - Refactored Subaccount service to use newly created DTOs.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.5 - Implemented missing DTOs related to Account services.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.4 - Implemented missing properties for Payment and Customer get responses.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.3 - Implemented missing PaymentService methods.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.2 - Implemented missing CustomerService methods and refactored Dto classes.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.1 - Fixed build issues and updated Readme.\n\t\t\t* 1.0.0 - Initial release.",
